## Predictive Text

Making online searches is a very common task we perform on our smartphones and laptops. The NLP algorithms generate a list of predictive text, that is, probable next words or phrases as soon as we type anything in the search bar. We can click on any predictive text that matches the information we are looking for to display the relevant websites. Predictive text improves the search speed, enhances our experience and ensures that the suggestions align with our intention.

